        "heading": "Where are obligations concentrated by market?",
        "body": "Medicinal and Botanical Manufacturing accounted for $4B in obligations. Drugs and Druggists' Sundries Merchant Wholesalers accounted for $2B. Pharmaceutical Preparation Manufacturing accounted for $639K. Those three NAICS markets capture the bulk of FY2026 to date obligations."
      }
